{"id":"658633","name":"香椿炒鸡蛋","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/658633/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香椿","amount":"50g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香椿洗干净。","img":"images/658633/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"开水下锅烫一下，10秒钟。","img":"images/658633/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加一点点油，和盐焯水。","img":"images/658633/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后香椿就变色了，绿色了，切段，鸡蛋打碎。","img":"images/658633/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋和香椿段拌在一起。","img":"images/658633/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里热油，鸡蛋香椿倒入，大火炒熟。","img":"images/658633/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香椿的味道……有点像树叉子。","img":"images/658633/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}